**Path pc0→pc12 routing chain (confirmed working):**
- pc0 (20.1.1.10) → r1 via 20.1.1.1 (directly connected)
- r1 → r11 via OSPF: `O>* 120.0.0.0/8 [110/20] via 111.1.1.2, eth1`
- r11 → r12 via EIGRP AS 100 on 112.x.x.x (EE segment)
